W&_nc_oc=AdoMtVhC4N-ccsGtSKLocIelbKut-Vc5ZXfmS4fpbwwWljAOKOm_dm6QHu8vWF5-A6o&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPg7Pe3WBNrUB3-DKpkvGXJ1KLI5eEhcxhoSj08TC58jA&oe=6AD24073"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "vlcsnap-2026-03-21-11h42m01s445.png", "id": "2815178258833957", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491820855_2815178262167290_5184697147728540086_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Luo6VwSUzQEQ7kNvwHX0wki&_nc_oc=AdpbaaQ76_4pxF2feJztpQq3F9ND3KDHbIlAuNFmwbTbeOBrDq2sVG68cBDr-Bkvcvo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQP79LW4rnbe2eGpePOf6F4ywYwDElgP2I6h2PCtqMpyGA&oe=6AD24ED2"}, "display_name": "Durlabh Darshan", "keywords": ["Spiritual", "Hindu", "3D", "Video", "360"], "long_description": "Durlabh Darshan is an immersive spiritual application that brings the divine experience closer to you through advanced Virtual Reality (VR) technology. The app offers high-quality 3D and 360\u00b0 videos of renowned temples and revered deities, allowing devotees to experience sacred spaces as if they were physically present. With daily Darshan from 14+ temples, users can stay spiritually connected no matter where they are.\n\nIn addition to temple visits, Durlabh Darshan features a unique 3D theatre experience showcasing devotional series and spiritual stories, designed to inspire and deepen your connection with faith. Whether you wish to attend Aarti, explore holy places, or simply find peace in a busy life, the app creates a serene and engaging environment for spiritual growth.\n\nA special highlight of Durlabh Darshan is the interactive 3D Abhishek feature, available for 12+ temples, where devotees can virtually perform sacred rituals and offer prayers in a deeply personal way. This feature enhances the feeling of participation and devotion, making spiritual practices more engaging and meaningful.\n\nWith user-friendly navigation, high-quality visuals, and regularly updated content, Durlabh Darshan ensures a seamless and enriching experience for devotees of all ages. Blending tradition with modern technology, it offers a convenient and powerful way to stay connected with faith anytime, anywhere.\n", "short_description": "Durlabh Darshan is a captivating spiritual application that invites users into the divine realm through immersive virtual reality (VR) experiences. This app offers a sacred journey, allowing devotees to explore Hindu gods, ancient temples, and worship from the comfort of their own space."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://durlabhdarshan.com/pages/privacy-policy-2", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "TechXR Innovations", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://techxr.co/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "810139357995560"}, {"id": "726368587961803"}, {"id": "434961926215971"}], "external_subscription_type": "REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "27078314621844647"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619485_1621887302267965_2614952782871862036_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=FBlllLMK1mAQ7kNvwHieiq9&_nc_oc=AdqAS_h8kA4TpI5vVA93jAwBWljQzjuK2Q7jKCAgJIFS1AcbJfyUpF5TZwdypTqvCWE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMBSoUFGG5XKpwSfjE97xEvmHjj1L-fb_A5Vd3HG